---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Fleur de Lise Healing" description="How Fleur de Lise Healing handles the information you share through this website." path="/privacy">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Your privacy" title="Privacy, in plain words" lead="Your privacy matters here. This page explains what this website collects and why." />
  <section class="section tex-ivory on-light">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="prose">
        <p><em>Last updated: November 2026</em></p>
        <h2>Who I am</h2>
        <p>This website is for {site.name}, a wellness practice in {site.location}, run by {site.owner}. You can reach me at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
        <h2>What the website collects</h2>
        <p>Only what you choose to send through the contact or appointment forms: your name, email, an optional phone number, your message and, for appointment inquiries, your service and timing preferences.</p>
        <p>At the moment, these forms open your own email app with your message ready to send to me. The website itself doesn’t store what you type.</p>
        <h2>Please keep health details out of forms and email</h2>
        <p>There’s no need to share sensitive health information before we meet. You can share what feels right during your session.</p>
        <h2>How I use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To reply to you and, if you ask, arrange an appointment.</li>
          <li>To let you know when a new service opens, if you ask me to.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>I don’t sell or share your information, and I don’t send marketing you haven’t asked for.</p>
        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>This website doesn’t use advertising cookies or tracking, and fonts are served directly from the site rather than from a third party.</p>
        <h2>Hosting</h2>
        <p>The site is hosted by Cloudflare, which may process technical information such as IP addresses to deliver and secure the website.</p>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can ask me what information I hold about you, to correct it, or to delete it, at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>If this changes — for example, when online booking is added — I’ll update this page.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
